<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115925" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῦχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύχω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>cold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				65.2
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλπος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				598a1
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καύματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				362b17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ψύχει</span> in
				<i>winter-time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ψ. καθηῦδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					220d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖγος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				97
			</span></i>: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύχεα</span>”
				<i>frosts, cold weather,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.28
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					5.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς σφόδρα ψ. καὶ ἐν ταῖς σφόδρα
					ἀλέαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					599a19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				379a26
			</span></i>; sg., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i>coolness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύχεος ἱμείρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.555
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. ἐν δόμοις πέλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					971
				</span></i>
			.</div>
